# chorus REJECTION vector: firmware chunk, protocol v2 message type 0x19.
#
# Committed, and never written by a test. A well-formed frame whose value the format does not
# accept: any implementation of chorus protocol v2 must reject it naming `transfer` (out of range),
# consume the whole frame and carry on with the next one, and must refuse to encode the fields in
# firmware_chunk_transfer_zero.fields (docs/protocol.md, "Decoder behaviour", step 5).
#
# Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# frame header: type 0x19, payload length 12 (0x000C), big-endian
19 00 0C

# transfer = 0
00 00 00 00

# offset = 0
00 00 00 00

# data: the rest of the frame, 4 bytes
E9 06 02 20
